This was my 3rd ascension, but 1st as spellcaster and 1st as chaotic.

After valk and samurai ascensions I wanted to see what else this game
offers, and try a spellcaster. And man it was difficult. I send a cry
for help at this ng
(http://groups.google.fi/group/rec.games.roguelike.nethack/browse_frm/thread/86b53503fe643632/)
and I have to thank for all the help I was given - it really made a
world of difference! With the advice given to me and watching Mrivan's
ttyrecs I soon got the hang of it, and had a buff wizard which was soon
in an ascension run.

Then I was lost in Oblivion for a couple of months (forgot Nethack
altogether). But, today I decided to continue my journey, exactly two
months after the last time I've started the game. I was proceeding my
way up the dungeons towards the planes when I paused Nethacking, so it
didn't take that long to finish the game after the restart.

After all this time I don't remember much about the early game, except
that I was really into throwing daggers and had plenty of wishes. When
I entered astral plane, I still had 3 charges left in a wand of
wishing, and also had a blessed figurine of Archon. This time I took
advantage of wands of teleport clearing the way around Astral plane,
and that made plane quite easy. I managed to find the right altar on
second try.

